== Notes ==	
* When the first phases of the War in Kryta were released, this boss was observed to spawn in the same location as either [[Cerris]] or [[Carnak the Hungry]] — or both. He has not been seen since April 2010 and is presumed to have been removed during one of the many updates affecting this part of [[Beyond]].

